s 4 grids October to November came in under 90% of normal in 38 of them. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 26% of normal in January to February and 136% in June to July. All 4 grids had their driest year in 1955, with grid 25335 at 58%. Grid 25337 shows a preliminary 186.3 for August to September 2026, an estimate from NOAA rain that can differ from RMA&rsquo;s final index.</p>"}
